sequenceDiagram
  actor Manager
  actor Admin
  participant UsersController
  participant CondominiumsController
  participant UnitsController
  participant UserService
  participant CondoService as CondominiumService
  participant UnitRepo

  Manager->>CondominiumsController: POST /api/platform/condominiums
  CondominiumsController->>CondoService: CreateCondominiumAsync(request)
  CondoService-->>CondominiumsController: condominium created
  CondominiumsController-->>Manager: 201 Created

  Manager->>UsersController: POST /api/platform/users
  UsersController->>UserService: CreateUserAsync(request)
  UserService-->>UsersController: user created (any role)
  UsersController-->>Manager: 201 Created

  Admin->>UsersController: POST /api/platform/users
  Note over UsersController: Admin can only create users in own condominium\nand cannot create Manager role.
  UsersController-->>Admin: 201 Created or 403

  Admin->>UnitsController: POST /api/condominiums/{id}/units
  UnitsController->>UnitRepo: Add unit for route condominium
  UnitRepo-->>UnitsController: unit persisted
  UnitsController-->>Admin: 201 Created

  Manager->>UnitsController: GET /api/condominiums/{id}/units
  UnitsController-->>Manager: units in requested condominium
